                                       external JWT signer APIs
  Ruby ports of upstream Go packages:
    lib/rubernetes/resource_helpers.rb
        k8s.io/component-helpers/resource
    lib/rubernetes/node_declared_features.rb
        k8s.io/component-helpers/nodedeclaredfeatures
