        k8s.io/apimachinery/pkg/api/resource (Quantity)
    lib/rubernetes/api/table_printer/json_path.rb
        k8s.io/client-go/util/jsonpath
    lib/rubernetes/dra/allocator.rb
        k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/structured
    lib/rubernetes/api/managed_fields/, lib/rubernetes/api/managed_fields.rb
        k8s.io/apimachinery/pkg/util/managedfields

  Beyond these ports, the API server, controllers, scheduler, node agent
  and proxy under lib/rubernetes/ are written to reproduce the observable
  behaviour of the corresponding Kubernetes components, and were written
  with the upstream source as a reference; source comments cite the
  upstream file a given rule comes from.

  lib/rubernetes/metrics_server/ does the same for
  sigs.k8s.io/metrics-server v0.8.0 (Copyright The Kubernetes Authors,
  Apache License 2.0).

  The Go programs under test/conformance/kubernetes/ are test oracles that
  build against the pinned Kubernetes source. They are not part of the
  shipped product.

